      "narrative": {
        "title": "Transforming",
        "titleLine2": "Businesses",
        "paragraph1": "Since 2009, Prem-Lichtwerbung has been crafting premium illuminated signage that transforms businesses into landmarks. What started as a small workshop in Germany has grown into a leading provider of custom lighting solutions across Europe.",
        "paragraph2": "We believe every business deserves signage that not only looks incredible but performs flawlessly for years. That's why we use only the highest-quality materials, LED technology, and weatherproof construction in every project."
      },
